                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I introduced the bipartisan Improving Law Enforcement Officer Safety and Wellness Through Data Act to protect those who protect us.\n\n342 officers were shot in 2024\u201450 killed. Already this year, 58 more have been shot, including 9 ambushed. And that\u2019s just what\u2019s been reported \u2014 many incidents go untracked.\n\nThis bill will close reporting gaps, expose violent trends, and ensure officers have access to the mental health care they deserve.",
