                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I just passed my first bill out of the U.S. House.\n\nI couldn't be prouder that it's a bipartisan bill that supports our men and women in law enforcement \u2014 the Improving Law Enforcement Officer Safety and Wellness Through Data Act.\n\nThis bill confronts the growing threats our officers face amid rising anti-police sentiment, ensuring they have the support and mental health resources they need to stay safe on the job.",
